#==============================================================================================
#
#   property_parsing_13 - parsing property values: transition, translate, scale,
#                         scroll-timeline, scrollbar-color, scrollbar-gutter
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/PropertyParsing.cpp (lines 4430-4727). parse_scroll_timeline_value's
#       function-local static (the initial scroll-timeline-axis) is a module variable set on first
#       use; it points into property_initial_value's cache, which lives for the whole program.
#
